    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765221979600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return an item.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765221984200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. To pull up your order, could I please get your full name and order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765221986066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Sterling. Order number VF-903-51B.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765221993599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I'm pulling that up now... Okay, I see the order for the Aero-Tech jersey. What specifically is the issue with it?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765221996399999
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222005333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I understand. Is there a technical fault with the jersey, or is it just a matter of preference on the fit?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222006866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It's too tight. It's obviously not made right.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222014533331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that it's not the right fit for you. I'm checking your delivery date and I see it was delivered 47 days ago. Our standard return policy is 90 days, so you are well within the window for a return.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222017799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. So what's the next step?",
