      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222032199997
    },
    {
      "text": "We have two options. We can process a full refund to your original payment method, or I can set up an exchange for a larger size. Which would you prefer?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222034666663
    },
    {
      "text": "I guess an exchange. For a large.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21511,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765222045066663
    },
    {
